WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.267
Prepared module files
Files were prepared before filming; this is a source walkthrough, not reenacted authorship.

2
00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:39.800
Local acceptance
The real Training Echo acceptance command verifies the exact CSV contract.

3
00:00:39.800 --> 00:01:01.867
Initial PR #54
Review the prepared module diff and updated head; required checks passed before merge.

4
00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:32.133
Initial merge: recorded September 30
Actual merge of PR #54; the released manifest starts disabled and hidden.

5
00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:41.600
Verify the registry
The live registry reflects the release. Coptis is held disabled and hidden.

6
00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:50.600
Deploy Silver admission policy
Real submit-job deployment from reviewed source. Registry CI does not deploy functions.

7
00:01:50.600 --> 00:02:08.600
Earlier publication attempt
This attempt was blocked. The next chapter verifies publication was unnecessary.

8
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:23.800
Verify publication necessity
Live Skill Catalog reads the registry. Preserve the different production frontend; no publish.

9
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:35.400
Enable and reveal: PR #56
Actual manifest edit, validation, branch, commit, push and pull request.

10
00:02:35.400 --> 00:03:13.400
Review, merge and registry release
Exact-head checks precede the merge. Match the workflow checkout to the intended commit.

11
00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:58.267
Live Silver run and CSV
The existing published UI discovers Training Echo; one real job returns the exact CSV.

12
00:03:58.267 --> 00:04:09.200
Maintain title, description and visibility
Actual manifest-only PR. No backend or frontend deployment is required for these fields.

13
00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:48.533
Release the maintenance change
The automatic registry projection updates metadata and hides discovery.

14
00:04:48.533 --> 00:05:03.533
Verify hide without deleting history
The live catalog no longer offers Training Echo. Existing jobs remain auditable.

15
00:05:03.533 --> 00:05:17.000
Change minimum tier: Silver to Gold
Actual policy edit plus manifest reveal. The backend enforces the new requirement.

16
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:55.933
Merge the Gold policy
Review and checks precede merge. Registry CI reveals the module but does not deploy policy.

17
00:05:55.933 --> 00:06:06.400
Deploy reviewed Gold admission
Deploy only submit-job. Confirm its deployed application sources match the reviewed commit.

18
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:29.000
Silver denied: no job created
Real browser submission receives HTTP 403 module_requires_upgrade; the job count is unchanged.

19
00:06:29.000 --> 00:07:18.733
Gold allowed: successful job and CSV
The same published UI accepts a Gold fixture and produces the expected private result.

20
00:07:18.733 --> 00:07:31.667
Disable and hide after demonstration
Actual final manifest PR. Retain execution history and results.

21
00:07:31.667 --> 00:08:11.067
Verify final registry release
Training Echo and Coptis both disabled and hidden after the final merge.

22
00:08:11.067 --> 00:08:53.067
Restore fixtures and verify closeout
Both exact original Platinum subscriptions restored; existing runtime walkthrough preserved.
